                                "sense_id": "6e89ba62-119d-3579-8906-1702f664f96e",
                                "text": "[…] proceeding, desperately, from such opiated catarrh preparations as Collis Brown's Mixture on to cocainized brain tonics, cigarettes soaked in absinthe, xylene in unventilated rooms, and so on […]"
                            }
                        ]
